$('search').oninput=()=>{render();fit();};$('close').onclick=()=>$('inspector').hidden=true;$('issues').onclick=showIssues;$('git').onclick=()=>showGit().catch(e=>banner(e.message));$('declutter').onclick=()=>{visualChange(()=>{prefs.visual={...visual(),clutter:visual().clutter==='all'?'selected neighborhood':'all'};});};$('settings').onclick=settings;$('styles').onclick=stylesPanel;$('fit').onclick=fit;$('back').onclick=()=>{navigateTo(displayNodes().find(n=>n.id===focus)?.parent||null);};$('layout').onclick=()=>previewLayout($('layoutChoice').value);$('undo').onclick=()=>history(undo,redo);$('redo').onclick=()=>history(redo,undo);$('list').onclick=()=>{const p=panel('Nodes in this view');for(const n of visible)button(p,n.label,()=>{selected=new Set([n.id]);inspect(n);render();});};
window.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(['INPUT','TEXTAREA','SELECT'].includes(e.target.tagName))return;if(e.altKey&&e.key==='ArrowLeft'){e.preventDefault();$('back').click();}if(e.key==='/'){e.preventDefault();$('search').focus();}if(e.key==='Escape'){$('inspector').hidden=true;selected.clear();impact.clear();render();}if(e.ctrlKey&&e.key==='z'){e.preventDefault();history(undo,redo);}if(e.ctrlKey&&e.key==='y'){e.preventDefault();history(redo,undo);}});
$('previousLayout').onclick=()=>flipLayout(-1);$('nextLayout').onclick=()=>flipLayout(1);$('healthBadge').onclick=()=>{const p=panel('Dashboard status');p.append(el('p',$('healthBadge').title),el('p','Green: connected and current. Yellow: checking, refreshing, or offline snapshot. Red: known changes awaiting refresh, a connection failure, or reported errors.'));if(!offline)button(p,'Refresh now',async()=>{healthHeartbeat.refreshing=true;updateHealth();try{await api('/api/refresh',{});state=await api('/api/state');healthHeartbeat={};lastContact=Date.now();connectionFailed=false;render();}catch(e){connectionFailed=true;updateHealth();banner(e.message);}});};setInterval(updateHealth,2000);load().catch(()=>{connectionFailed=true;updateHealth();});setInterval(async()=>{if(offline||!state)return;try{const heartbeat=await api('/api/heartbeat');healthHeartbeat=heartbeat;lastContact=Date.now();connectionFailed=false;updateHealth();if(pendingSave)await save();if(heartbeat.revision!==rev){const updated=await api('/api/state');state=updated;rev=updated.revision;render();}else{const nextGit=await api('/api/git');if(JSON.stringify(nextGit)!==JSON.stringify(state.git)){state=await api('/api/state');rev=state.revision;render();}}if(heartbeat.error)banner(heartbeat.error);}catch{connectionFailed=true;updateHealth();banner('Local service unavailable. Your last graph is stale; restart the launcher to reconnect.');}},5000);

let overviewResize;window.addEventListener('resize',()=>{clearTimeout(overviewResize);overviewResize=setTimeout(()=>{if(overviewMode()){render();fit();}},120);});

$('canvas').addEventListener('pointerleave',()=>hoverConnections());
